<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dole Food cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dole Food cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Dole Food Co Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 2-3/8 to 37-3/8.</p>
</text>
